s required for crafting the item\n  actions_to_take, workshop_name = navigate_and_collect(env, item)\n  \n  # Craft the item at the closest available workshop\n  actions_to_take.extend(craft_item_at_workshop(env, workshop_name))\n  \n  return actions_to_take", "island_id": 3, "scores": {"3": 7.2}}
